# ============================================================
# Firebase Cloud Functions — Secret Environment Variables
# ============================================================
# 
# This file is used by the Firebase Emulator when running locally.
# Copy this file to .secret.local and fill in your actual values.
#
# For PRODUCTION deployment, set secrets using:
#   firebase functions:secrets:set GEMINI_API_KEY
#
# SECURITY WARNING:
# - NEVER commit .secret.local with real keys to version control.
# - NEVER paste your API key into frontend HTML/JS/CSS files.
# - The API key is ONLY used server-side inside Cloud Functions.
# ============================================================

# Google Gemini API Key (required for AI Visual Quality Assessment)
# Get your key from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here